#This is a tab separated file describing the location of antiSMASH databases
#used for the Antismash tool
#
#file has this format (white space characters are TAB characters)
#
#The columns are:
#value	name	path	version
#
#For example
#antismash_databases_8.0.4	antiSMASH databases 8.0.4	/path/to/antismash_databases	8.0.4
